msgctxt "80"
msgid "Uncle Kaz..."
msgstr "Zio Kaz..."

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Hey, didn't I tell you not to worry? I'll make this right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Oh, and Taichi. I don't want you mentioning this to the\r\n"
"others, you hear me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Same for you, Mitsuo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "I won't!"
msgstr "Non lo farò!"

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Ryukyu Elementary, Hashimoto speaking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Hi there, my name is Kiryu from Morning Glory, and⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"The orphanage, right? You must be the guardian for all those\r\n"
"poor kids."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "And who are you, exactly?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Oh, just one of the teachers here at the school."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Perfect. I'm actually calling about one of my kids, Shiro.\r\n"
"Could I speak with his teacher?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "That would be me. What seems to be the problem?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Well, I have reason to believe he's been getting bullied..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Bullied? What evidence do you have of that, hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Is this some kind of joke!?"
msgstr "È una specie di scherzo?"

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"Trust me, I'm not the joking type. Shiro's holed up in his\r\n"
"room right now, not talking to anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Apparently there have been bruises on his body, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"I assure you, there is no chance such awful behavior would\r\n"
"take place at our school!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "What about the other orphans?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"Who knows what those kids of yours get up to without parents\r\n"
"around to keep them in check."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "What did you say!?"
msgstr "Che hai detto!?"

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"Honestly, I'm sick and tired of all these nervous parents\r\n"
"whining to me about their children!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"Raising them is your responsibility, not mine! Though\r\n"
"I suppose your case may be a lost cause."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Goodbye, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "*beep* *beep* *beep*"
msgstr "*bip* *bip* *bip*"

msgctxt "464"
msgid "What was his problem...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Uncle Kaz..."
msgstr "Zio Kaz..."

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, Taichi. I'm gonna make sure this never happens\r\n"
"again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Ma..."

msgctxt "512"
msgid "It's okay. I'll get Shiro to talk."
msgstr ""

